# What check.sh must find at the sync commit in SKILL.md: each rule that
# breaks in a setup, with TLC's shortest path to it (the actions, after
# the initial state). Every rule not listed holds. A line goes only when
# the code it describes changed, with the reason in the same change.
#
# Finding 1, a second confirmed run while the first still
# runs (OneRemovalAtATime in remove/reload and remove/draw), left with the
# fix for #12: src-tauri holds a confirmed run from before residue starts
# until it returns and refuses a second one meanwhile, and keeps a marker
# naming residue's process, which a relaunched app reads
# (src-tauri/src/removal.rs). The window asks src-tauri when it starts and
# when the removal dialog closes, and keeps Move to the trash off until
# that run ends (SKILL.md, "Findings").
#
# save/during came with the fix for #11 and adds no line: with a terminal
# or brew changing the service while a save runs, every rule holds, since
# install passes the dialog's fingerprint to residue as --expect. Without
# it (the NoExpect mutant), three rules break there (SKILL.md, Finding 2).
#
# save/copy came with the fix for Findings 3 and 4 and adds no line: a save
# with the app's own copy puts the copy back when residue writes nothing,
# and copies only the residue the read named, which each service command
# reads again. The code before it (NoPutBack, CachedVersion, NoCopyCheck)
# breaks FailedSaveKeepsTheResidue and SaveIsWhatTheDialogShowed there.
# Finding 7 is open (SKILL.md, "Findings"): the moment between the app's
# last check and residue's own read, which only residue-cli can close.
# remove/during lets the worktree at a path change after src-tauri's plan
# at the click and before residue's own plan in the confirmed run; both
# rules break there by the same path. Its other rules hold, and
# remove/no-faults, which leaves that moment out, holds every rule. A line
# goes when residue-cli takes what the confirm showed. save/redirect-during
# adds no line: src-tauri checks the folders right before residue starts,
# one step with residue's own resolve in the model.
remove/during OnlyListedWorktreesMove: YouTick YouClickMove PlanLands YouConfirm ReplanLands Replace RunMoves
remove/during OnlyListedEntriesPurged: YouTick YouClickMove PlanLands YouConfirm ReplanLands Replace RunMoves
